WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:08.460
Clarence Thomas: You are men and women of
Hillsdale, steeped in the best traditions

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:11.620
and principles of our great nation.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:16.180
If you don’t lead by example, who will?

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.540
Nick: Today, the Liberal Arts are under attack,
and Hillsdale College is the best defense

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.550
it could hope for.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.399
We’ve read the old books and engaged in
a dialogue which recognizes that the answers are

00:00:26.399 --> 00:00:28.520
not easily found.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.279
We went scuba diving at Sombrero Reef.

00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:31.349
It was amazing.

00:00:31.349 --> 00:00:36.809
It was cool to be on my own and just explore,
see all the fish and all the colors, explore

00:00:36.809 --> 00:00:38.510
the caves that the eels were hiding in.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.980
It was just a great experience

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:47.420
The trip was a really cool combination of
the biblical sites and being exposed to the

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:50.580
geo-political situation in Israel.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.180
They’re not going to get him.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:55.480
To the five, he’s going to the end zone!

00:00:55.489 --> 00:00:56.489
Touchdown!

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.140
Bart Spieth: Our shotgun team is really great.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.600
They are very competitive.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.640
They've won four of the last five years in Division III national championships.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.860
Larry Arnn: The College is old. It’s a wonderful
thing about it.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:25.160
It was founded by heroes and wise people.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:29.840
They founded it just like the United States
was founded: according to principles they

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.300
claim to be eternal.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.760
Scott Pruitt: The importance of who replaces
Justice Scalia, and the principles that they

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:40.170
embody will make a huge difference in the
liberties and freedoms that we have in the

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:41.170
future.

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.020
David Clarke: There is no higher honor than
to wear the uniform of the United States

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.430
and go and defend freedom.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:47.430
There is no higher honor.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:49.670
Jeff Sessions: I love this Constitution.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.190
I love the rule of law.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:58.360
It’s a rare, special, unbelievably valuable
and unique tradition that we inherited.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:03.950
Clarence Thomas: This is Hillsdale College,
and you are special—that shining City on

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:04.950
a Hill.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:10.220
May God bless each of you now and throughout your
lives, and may God bless America.

